anotherWay.text:
```text
lucky_book --+
             +--> {}
book       --+

book = {...}
lucky_book ----> {}
book       ----> {new}
```
`book[spell_name] = spell` writes into the book both names point at. `book = {...}` moves the name `book` to a new book. The name `lucky_book` never moved, so its book stays as it was.

