```python
def brew(cook, name):
    pot = cook["shelf"][name]
    if cook["skill"] < pot["skill"]:
        print("Too hard.")
    elif cook["herb"] < pot["cost"]:
        print("Need herbs.")
    else:
        pot["effect"](cook)
        # then pay: the line below
```
